      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 80,
      "outputTokens": 589,
      "costUsd": 0.005341,
      "pronunciationText": "But expanding gave a different-looking answer. Which one is right? Expand the bracket answer. It's four x cubed over three, plus two x squared, plus x, plus one sixth. That's the expanded answer, plus one sixth. On the graph, they're the same shape, a constant gap apart. So both are primitives, and the C absorbs the difference."
