      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 147,
      "outputTokens": 989,
      "costUsd": 0.0089745,
      "pronunciationText": "Now the starter. Three over the root of four t plus one is three, times four t plus one to the minus a half. Raise the power to a half. Then divide by the new power, a half, and by the inner rate, four. Three over two is one and a half, so the rise is one and a half times the root of four t plus one, plus C. At t equals zero it hasn't risen yet, so one and a half, plus C, is zero, and C is minus one and a half. After six hours, the root of twenty-five is five. So it has risen seven and a half, minus one and a half, which is six centimetres."
    },
